  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFAT Pacific Labour Mobility Support Program  (PLMSP) (2023-2032)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Labour Mobility Support Program will support the Pacific Australia Labour Mobility scheme to deliver increased opportunities for Pacific and Timorese workers to gain skills and income from working in priority Australian industry sectors.  The estimated value of the program is $340 million over eight years.</narrative>
  </description>
